infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Where config fails decides who suffers
  desc Boot-time validation is absorbed by the rollout; a lazy read detonates in production days later
  compares
    - label Boot-time Load() + validate
      children
        - label Fails inside the deploy
          desc Readiness probe halts the rollout in ~1 minute
        - label Old pods keep serving
          desc Zero user traffic lost during the halt
        - label An engineer is already watching
          desc Tue 14:07, coffee in hand, system built to roll back
        - label LookupEnv rejects bad config loudly
          desc Unset is not empty; malformed values fail at boot
    - label Lazy Getenv in the handler
      children
        - label Detonates at request time
          desc Sat 3:12 a.m., 4 days after the deploy shipped
        - label Reaches users under load
          desc 2000 goroutines/sec pile up, memory follows, OOM
        - label Empty string becomes a silent zero
          desc Atoi error ignored; zero meant no timeout
        - label On-call reconstructs cold history
          desc The deploy that caused it is 4 days cold
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f43f5e
